pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">🍬32 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">🍬40 <a href=\"/wiki/Candy\" title=\"Candy\">Candy</a>/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.40.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">October 7th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Hallow Tree</b> is an exclusive tree introduced in the Halloween 2023 update, and readded in the Halloween 2024 and 2025 updates. In the HW 2023 event, it can only spawn when a Halloween Meteor crashes, but in the HW 2024 event, this meteor was renamed to the Skeletal Meteor.\n</p><p>The <b>Hallow Tree</b>, not to be confused with the <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone Tree</a>, spawns in the middle of a crater as a rib-like structure with a <a href=\"/wiki/Hallow_Eye\" title=\"Hallow Eye\">Hallow Eye</a> placed within its ribs. While attached to the tree, it will fire a laser that deals consistent damage at the closest player. The Hallow Eye can be collected once the tree is chopped down. The hallow eye is worth 250 candy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Bring a <a href=\"/wiki/Healing_Coil\" title=\"Healing Coil\">Healing Coil</a> or a <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a> when the meteor lands. This allows you to take breaks from the Hallow Eye's damage and continue chopping it down.</li>\n<li>Hallow Trees are extremely tough. The <a href=\"/wiki/Emberbane\" title=\"Emberbane\">Emberbane's</a> special ability does not work if the tree hasn't been chopped off, although it will work once it has been chopped. A <a href=\"/wiki/Living_Axe\" title=\"Living Axe\">Living Axe</a> is recommended for cutting the tree to make it easier to carry around (although you can use a Grabber) and a <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Tall Refined Axe</a> is recommended for chopping the tree into smaller pieces.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>This tree was one of the only trees to have square logs, before it was changed to the normal cylinder log.</li>\n<li>The sawed form looks like and act like refined quartz.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Hallow Tree (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6SGFsbG93X1RyZWU/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"